{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4eb2841514a0ec5c9a2699724f57ac279c524d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"32\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4f56670a613c679c0291375283e37df33f3a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> are listed in order from smallest to largest, the list is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0ea008fdb5355a493f259921d9cde6e3bbdf29f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   3, \\frac{5}{2}, \\sqrt{10}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   \\frac{5}{2}, 3, \\sqrt{10}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   \\sqrt{10}, \\frac{5}{2}, 3  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   \\frac{5}{2}, \\sqrt{10}, 3 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   3, \\sqrt{10}, \\frac{5}{2}  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"697\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824911de6b0b4894e499d578d9515382ff3d3628.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10} &gt; \\sqrt{9} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f3729a716ef53af10e004c367b030200af24e6e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10} &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/599a865bb1d39c8801030a30ec37514eb09f9874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2} = 2.5 &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b68818bd88f1ef3db8fe4a9b0f3b7d71902348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2} &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, ordering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/e/d9e524bb9749a81d196f0a73cf30287c6ff2ebe8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, \\sqrt{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c4f56670a613c679c0291375283e37df33f3a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> from smallest to largest, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/c/75c93883ed6c90b244463481e8dc90a36f6df844.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } \\frac{5}{2}, 3, \\sqrt{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"120\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Pr